    "locationAr": "المدينة الصناعية الثانية",
    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>Work was done on building the factory and developing the technologies required for the first production line during 2016.</li>\r\n\t<li>The company announced the start of production at the factory of valves in 2017.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
